OL,3,GNEWSAFears over Birmingham Airport
OL,4,Aexpansion plans as bosses eye 50,000
OL,5,Amore jobs
OL,6,
OL,7,FPlans to expand Birmingham Airport have
OL,8,Fprompted a mixed reaction from
OL,9,Fresidents and business leaders.
OL,11,FThe airport has unveiled a #2bn plan
OL,12,Fwhich could more than double passenger
OL,13,Fnumbers to 30 million and create more
OL,14,Fthan 50,000 jobs, 3,800 of them on
OL,15,Fsite.
OL,17,FWhile some people who live under flight
OL,18,Fpaths near the airport have questioned
OL,19,Fthe impact of future growth on local
OL,20,Fcommunities, business groups have
OL,21,Fwelcomed the plans as a boost for the
OL,22,FWest Midlands.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
