OL,3,GNEWSAFears over Birmingham Airport
OL,4,Aexpansion plans as bosses eye 50,000
OL,5,Amore jobs
OL,6,
OL,7,FRaj Kandola, deputy chief executive of
OL,8,Fthe Greater Birmingham Chambers of
OL,9,FCommerce, told BBC Radio WM the plans
OL,10,Fwere a "massive vote of confidence" for
OL,11,Fthe region.
